{"pageid":2115,"title":"Update Log/Version 1.46.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Update Log/Version 1.46.0</span>","revid":9396,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #3C3C3C; background:#505050; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:semi-bold\">This page is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Stubs\" title=\"Category:Stubs\">stub</a>!</span><br />\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Update_Log/Version_1.46.0?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.<br /><small><b>Note</b>: Certified Secret Friday update moment (devs are sneaky and hid the changes)</small></span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This page contains all the changes made in <b>Version 1.46.0</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Official_update_log\">Official update log</span></h2>\n<p><b>Added</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Some new content additions have been added to the game! Can you find them? (BHL, FHL, NT, HP)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes\">Changes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bamboo\" title=\"Bamboo\">Bamboo</a> once again spawns on the beach in front of the <a href=\"/wiki/Radical_Shack\" title=\"Radical Shack\">Radical Shack</a>.</li>\n<li>Added a new set of items to <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a>, above the shelf with the <a href=\"/wiki/Property_Spawn_Location\" title=\"Property Spawn Location\">Property Spawn Locations</a>:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fairy_Hanging_Lights\" title=\"Fairy Hanging Lights\">Fairy Hanging Lights</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bulb_Hanging_Lights\" title=\"Bulb Hanging Lights\">Bulb Hanging Lights</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hanging_Pennants\" title=\"Hanging Pennants\">Hanging Pennants</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Neon_Tube\" title=\"Neon Tube\">Neon Tube</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163715\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 30/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 775/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 168/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    3.267      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    3.267      1 -total\n 39.49%    1.290      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2115-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163715 and revision id 9396. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs"],"links":[{"title":"Category:Stubs","exists":true},{"title":"Bamboo","exists":true},{"title":"Bulb Hanging Lights","exists":true},{"title":"Fairy Hanging Lights","exists":true},{"title":"Hanging Pennants","exists":true},{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true},{"title":"Neon Tube","exists":true},{"title":"Property Spawn Location","exists":true},{"title":"Radical Shack","exists":true}],"images":[]}
